{"version":1,"content":"<p>車婉婉、樊亦敏、歐瑞偉、李偉健（Terry）、徐榮、何依婷、趙浚承今天（27日）換上鬼馬造型，宣傳《愛‧回家之三代同糖》，到將軍澳鬧市巡遊，監製羅永賢也有到場，吸引市民圍觀。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:27.252862+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T12:58:25.020297+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:27.252862+00:00","content_hash":"1c72e05834baab0f1eabee5389f820abe877787d6dda43054bfe62297d99514c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}